---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms & Conditions | Livart Beauty Academy" description="Terms of service and enrollment conditions for Livart Beauty Academy.">
	<div class="pt-32 pb-16 px-margin-sm lg:px-margin-lg max-w-[800px] mx-auto text-on-surface">
		<h1 class="font-display-lg text-[48px] tracking-tight mb-8">Terms & Conditions</h1>
		<div class="prose prose-invert prose-p:text-on-surface-variant max-w-none">
			<p>Effective Date: September 2026</p>
			<h3>1. Enrollment and Admission</h3>
			<p>Enrollment into any course at Livart Beauty Academy is subject to availability and the fulfillment of basic admission criteria. The academy reserves the right to deny admission if application requirements are not met.</p>
			<h3>2. Fee Payment and Refunds</h3>
			<p>Course fees must be paid according to the schedule provided at the time of admission. Registration fees are non-refundable. Prorated refunds for tuition may be considered only under exceptional, documented medical emergencies.</p>
			<h3>3. Certification</h3>
			<p>Certificates, including B&WSSC affiliations, are awarded only upon the successful completion of the course curriculum, fulfilling minimum attendance requirements (typically 80%), and passing the final practical evaluations.</p>
			<h3>4. Academy Rules</h3>
			<p>Students must adhere to the professional dress code and hygiene standards required on the salon floor. Any damage to academy equipment due to negligence will be billed to the responsible student.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
